    "detailed_description": "A classic formula with new mind breaking twists.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relearn</h2>Experience the thrill of being a beginner again and reach for mastery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recombined</h2>Retro glitch aesthetics and mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> &quot;Broken&quot; pieces with a whole new set of interesting possibilities and challenges. <br></li><li> Gain &quot;Pills&quot; to remove any piece that you don't want.<br></li><li> &quot;Corruption Trail&quot;: Speed up any piece to be able to remove all lines at once.<br></li><li> Puzzle mode with over 50 handcrafted puzzles that teaches new techniques.<br></li><li> Choose between 3 original musical themes.<br></li><li> Cat mascot!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A classic formula with new mind breaking twists.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relearn</h2>Experience the thrill of being a beginner again and reach for mastery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recombined</h2>Retro glitch aesthetics and mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> &quot;Broken&quot; pieces with a whole new set of interesting possibilities and challenges. <br></li><li> Gain &quot;Pills&quot; to remove any piece that you don't want.<br></li><li> &quot;Corruption Trail&quot;: Speed up any piece to be able to remove all lines at once.<br></li><li> Puzzle mode with over 50 handcrafted puzzles that teaches new techniques.<br></li><li> Choose between 3 original musical themes.<br></li><li> Cat mascot!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fresh take on the the falling block puzzle genre. Embrace imperfection with glitches and broken pieces to overcome this new challenge. Chase high scores or learn new techniques in a puzzle mode with over 50 handcrafted puzzles.",
